人东诣太祖，表拜列侯","accounts":[{"id":"liusima-a-5f4f52622978998c0bc7","label":"裴注·魏略","text":"阎行勒部曲与韩遂相攻击不胜，将家人东诣太祖，表拜列侯","evidence":["liusima-q-ef16dae97c72e7bcb04d"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0048","role":"使行别领西平郡","evidence":["liusima-q-ef16dae97c72e7bcb04d"]},{"person":"liusima-p0065","role":"遂勒其部曲与约相攻击，不胜，乃将家人东诣太祖","evidence":["liusima-q-ef16dae97c72e7bcb04d"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"表拜行列侯","evidence":["liusima-q-ef16dae97c72e7bcb04d"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["liusima-q-ef16dae97c72e7bcb04d"]},"ordering_evidence":"liusima-q-ef16dae97c72e7bcb04d","source_order":[15,180,549],"order":3322}],"persons":[{"id":"liusima-p0065","name":"阎行","evidence":["liusima-q-d3692c4fe6062d157916","liusima-q-4b207a53737952e1dc72","liusima-q-615deca456ab52a44059","liusima-q-25104ac12b07a8c157ab","liusima-q-58bf48ffd03a152e46ea","liusima-q-50e523d8283ce55e0010","liusima-q-52a2610bb83ac7baf663","liusima-q-41f13739e86c800c9d68","liusima-q-74a36b3a13b2a0b2bf9f","liusima-q-243fd01ef0b93735c1e2","liusima-q-a561fbc25906c98cf323","liusima-q-ef16dae97c72e7bcb04d"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"liusima-q-243fd01ef0b93735c1e2","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-d45634d3e6a532a1e9b7","layer":"pei","quote":"乃手书与行曰：‘观文约所为，使人笑来。吾前后与之书，无所不说；如此，何可复忍！卿父谏议，自平安也。虽然，牢狱之中，非养亲之处；且又官家亦不能久为人养老也","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":179,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-c64b31dc74be282c0ef8","start":434,"end":510},{"id":"liusima-q-25104ac12b07a8c157ab","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-d45634d3e6a532a1e9b7","layer":"pei","quote":"至十四年，为约所使诣太祖。太祖厚遇之，表拜犍为太守","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":179,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-c64b31dc74be282c0ef8","start":78,"end":103},{"id":"liusima-q-41f13739e86c800c9d68","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-d45634d3e6a532a1e9b7","layer":"pei","quote":"及太祖与约交马语，行在其后；太祖望谓行曰：‘当念作孝子","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":179,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-c64b31dc74be282c0ef8","start":374,"end":401},{"id":"liusima-q-4b207a53737952e1dc72","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-fe0f3567e6b3112d284b","layer":"pei","quote":"遂宿有恩于羌，羌卫护之。及夏侯渊还，使阎行留后。乃合羌胡数万，将攻行，行欲走。会遂死，英降太祖","attribution":"裴注·典略","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":178,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-c64b31dc74be282c0ef8","start":255,"end":302},{"id":"liusima-q-50e523d8283ce55e0010","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-d45634d3e6a532a1e9b7","layer":"pei","quote":"行因谓约曰：‘行亦为将军兴军以来，三十余年，民兵疲瘁，所处又狭，宜早自附。是以前在邺，自启当令老父诣京师；诚谓将军，亦宜遣一子，以示丹赤。’约曰：‘且可复观望数岁中。’后遂遣其子，与行父母俱东","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":179,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-c64b31dc74be282c0ef8","start":159,"end":255},{"id":"liusima-q-52a2610bb83ac7baf663","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-d45634d3e6a532a1e9b7","layer":"pei","quote":"行谏约，不欲令与超合。约谓行曰：‘今诸将不谋而同，似有天数。’乃东诣华阴","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":179,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-c64b31dc74be282c0ef8","start":337,"end":373},{"id":"liusima-q-58bf48ffd03a152e46ea","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-d45634d3e6a532a1e9b7","layer":"pei","quote":"行因请令其父，入宿卫；西还见约，宣太祖教云：‘谢文约：卿始起兵时，自有所逼，我所具明也。当早来，共匡辅国朝","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":179,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-c64b31dc74be282c0ef8","start":104,"end":157},{"id":"liusima-q-615deca456ab52a44059","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-d45634d3e6a532a1e9b7","layer":"pei","quote":"建安初，约与马腾相攻击。腾子超，亦号为健。行尝刺超，矛折，因以折矛挝超项，几杀之","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":179,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-c64b31dc74be282c0ef8","start":37,"end":77},{"id":"liusima-q-74a36b3a13b2a0b2bf9f","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-d45634d3e6a532a1e9b7","layer":"pei","quote":"及超等破走，行随约还金城。太祖闻行前意，故但诛约子孙在京师者","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":179,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-c64b31dc74be282c0ef8","start":403,"end":433},{"id":"liusima-q-a561fbc25906c98cf323","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-d45634d3e6a532a1e9b7","layer":"pei","quote":"约闻行父独在，欲使并遇害，以一其心；乃强以少女妻行，行不获已。太祖果疑行","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":179,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-c64b31dc74be282c0ef8","start":512,"end":548},{"id":"liusima-q-d3692c4fe6062d157916","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-fe0f3567e6b3112d284b","layer":"pei","quote":"韩遂在湟中，其婿阎行，欲杀遂以降，夜攻遂，不下。遂叹息曰：‘丈夫困厄，祸起婚姻乎","attribution":"裴注·典略","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":178,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-c64b31dc74be282c0ef8","start":63,"end":103},{"id":"liusima-q-ef16dae97c72e7bcb04d","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-d45634d3e6a532a1e9b7","layer":"pei","quote":"会约使行，别领西平郡。遂勒其部曲，与约相攻击；行不胜，乃将家人东诣太祖。太祖表拜列侯","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":179,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-c64b31dc74be282c0ef8","start":549,"end":591}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
